  "text": "We will use the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)(a-b)={a}^{2}-{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=7$ and $b=t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(7-t)(7+t) & = \\\\ {7}^{2}-{t}^{2} & = \\\\ 49-{t}^{2} & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
